# Restriction checkboxes for TS_GridColumns_v1.tt (see Docs/Reference.md section 3).
# Support code for the Columns list of every Angular grid; it does not depend on a table. The menu offers it on the database, the CLI runs it without -t.
DatabaseOnly=true
RequiresPrimaryKey=false
TableOnly=false
# No OutputName: the template writes its own paths (grid-columns.ts and its spec) with @@@FILE markers.
# Whole-project generation (codegen generate): the stacks that include this template, the tables it runs for and where its files go.
Stacks=Angular
OutputFolder=src/app
